# Copy this file to .dev.vars, and replace the value before starting the API.
# Set ENCRYPTION_KEY as a Cloudflare Worker Secret for deployment (see README.md).
# 管理员用户名和密码在首次打开网站时通过引导页设置（存于 Durable Object 数据库），
# 无需在此配置。ENCRYPTION_KEY 是加密 R2 账号凭据的根密钥，生成后请勿更改。
ENCRYPTION_KEY=replace-with-a-random-secret-at-least-32-characters-long
